        "text": "Freezing does not mean immediate recovery: the balance may be insufficient, an account may fall within a statutory exclusion, and the value frozen must comply with Clause 4, Article 133 of the 2015 Civil Procedure Code. In particular, Clause 3, Article 4 of Resolution No. 02/2020/NQ-HĐTP provides an exclusion for corporate accounts used to discharge obligations to credit institutions pursuant to credit agreements."
