        "text": "Attachment of property in dispute (Article 120) differs from freezing property held for safekeeping (Article 125). Each measure is subject to its own conditions. A business must identify the property, the person managing it, ownership and the grounds for applying the measure, rather than relying on a general allegation of risk."
