        "type": "p",
        "text": "The application must specify the measure sought, the reasons for the request, the person against whom it is sought and the assets concerned, and be accompanied by documents establishing its necessity under Article 133 of the Civil Procedure Code. If the Court does not grant the request, it must notify the applicant in writing and state its reasons in accordance with the statutory procedure. Businesses should prepare three categories of evidence:"
